Agent: Apply when changing control plane service, outbox, or admin HTTP APIs.

Control Plane

Cold-path control plane: HTTP admin on `:8188`, payment webhooks on `:8187`, background workers, licensing. Hot path (`/track`, Redis Lua, XDP) is out of scope.

**Cold-path rules:** `.cursor/rules/cold-path.mdc` — mandatory for admin/billing/payment/notifier/costsync edits (no Provider interfaces, no `map[string]any` payloads, minimal LoC).

`.cursor/rules/data-layer.mdc` . `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` . `.cursor/rules/code-style.mdc` . `.cursor/rules/service-boundaries.mdc`

1. Topology

Administrative traffic does not share the tracker event loop. Reporting and mutations use PostgreSQL as system of record; Redis receives config via outbox only.

Clients (operator JSON API, self-serve API) -> `cmd/control` HTTP -> `internal/controlplane` / `adminapi` / workers -> PG, Redis. Domain modules (`identity`, `payment`, `ledger`, `notify`) run in-process via `CONTROL_ENABLE_*`. Tracker -> streams -> processor -> PG, CH. Self-hosted layers: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md`.

1.1 Binaries

`cmd/control`: modular monolith — HTTP gateway, RBAC, outbox, in-process auth/payment/billing/notifier, margin-guard/cost-sync workers
`cmd/processor`: Redis streams -> PG events, `balance_ledger`, CH batches
`cmd/ivt-detector`, `cmd/fraud-scorer`: CH batch -> control outbox -> Redis blacklists

1.2 Route prefixes

| Prefix | Audience |
| :--- | :--- |
| `/api/v1/*` | Operators, automation |
| `/api/v1/selfserve/*` | Advertiser API keys |
| `/admin/*` | Deprecated HTMX |

2. Outbox

Mutations that affect delivery enqueue `outbox_events` in the same PG transaction as the config change. Workers apply Redis side effects. Direct HTTP writes to Redis from handlers are forbidden.

3. Workers (in `cmd/control`)

Volume meter, recon, ledger invariant, slot migration, brand MAB, bid-floor optimizer, ops metric scraper, etc. Never run these in tracker replicas.

4. Settlement

Payment webhooks -> payment module outbox -> in-process `SettlementHandler` -> `balance_ledger`. No network settlement RPC.

5. RBAC

Permissions gate routes (`campaigns:read`, `customers:write`, `shards:read`, `audit:read`, …). Contracts are godoc on handlers and DTOs in `internal/controlplane/adminapi`.

6. Reporting

Campaign stats: PG `campaign_stats` + CH MVs (`stale=true` when CH lag > 5 min). Balances from `balance_ledger` only.

7. License gates

`licensing` snapshot gates modules (multi-region, CH paths, etc.). Hot path reads JWT snapshot only.
